<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks fell, four rose and five were flat in 40.3-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,624.6 points, 0.9 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 1.3 percent in a 17.5-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
